# Private sensor data for local development only. Never commit these:
# spectral responses / reconstruction matrices, and hsi_reconstruct.m outputs
# (its _cube.mat files contain the QE curves too). Point the optional
# comparison test at them with IAT_LOCAL_HSI_DATA instead (see tests/tst_hsi.cpp).
local_data/
**/reconstruction_matrix*
**/*_cube.mat
**/*QE*.csv
**/*QE*.xlsx
hsi_*.tif
hsi_*.tiff
# Sensor profiles hold paths to the files above; correction matrices and
# exported cubes (ENVI .hdr/.img, multi-page TIFF) can hold sensor data too.
*.iatsensor
**/*correction_matrix*
**/*correctionMatrix*
*.hdr
*.img
*_cube.tif
*_cube.tiff
